abstract: >-
  Verse & Variable is an independent literary and scientific journal
  exploring Indian and South Asian literary traditions, poetry, shayari,
  philosophy, human experience, and interdisciplinary scientific thought.
  Its scientific interests include nonlinear vibrations, nonlinear waves,
  nonlinear ultrasonics, harmonic generation and scattering, mechanical
  metamaterials, computational mechanics, and related fields. The
  publication brings literary interpretation and scientific inquiry
  into thoughtful dialogue while preserving their distinct intellectual
  and cultural identities.

